exp="Weight loss, loose stools, warm moist skin, tremor, wide pulse pressure and resting tachycardia → <b>hyperthyroidism</b> → <b>TSH</b>. Dr. Segal (dyspnea buckets): anxiety is real, but <b>rule out the serious, organic causes first</b> (arrhythmia, <b>thyroid</b>, anemia) before labeling it panic. Her normal hemoglobin excludes anemia.<br><br><b>Educational objective:</b> Before diagnosing anxiety or panic in a patient with palpitations and dyspnea, exclude organic causes such as hyperthyroidism.",
